      <h1>Build and learn with VisualAcademy.</h1>
      <p>ASP.NET Core와 Blazor 기반의 학습 자료와 실전 업무용 예제를 하나의 웹사이트에서 만나보세요.</p>
      <div class="az-hero-actions">
        <a class="az-button az-button-primary az-button-large" href="/dashboard">Open dashboard</a>
        <a class="az-button az-button-outline az-button-large" href="/aspnetcore-roadmap/index.html">Roadmap</a>
        <a class="az-button az-button-outline az-button-large" href="/Articles">Articles</a>
      </div>
      <div class="az-hero-note"><span class="az-status-dot"></span> .NET 11 · Blazor Server · ASP.NET Core Identity</div>
    </div>
    <div class="az-cloud-visual" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="az-visual-toolbar"><span></span><span></span><span></span><strong>VisualAcademy</strong></div>
      <div class="az-visual-body">
        <div class="az-visual-sidebar"></div>
        <div class="az-visual-canvas">
          <div class="az-visual-heading"></div>
          <div class="az-visual-card-row"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          <div class="az-visual-chart"><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="az-trust-strip">
  <div class="az-shell-width"><span>ASP.NET Core 11</span><span>Blazor Server</span><span>Identity</span><span>Razor Pages + MVC</span></div>
</section>

<section class="az-feature-section az-shell-width">
  <div class="az-section-heading"><span class="az-eyebrow">Site areas</span><h2>Learning and application areas.</h2></div>
  <div class="az-feature-grid">
    <article><span class="az-feature-icon">☁</span><h3>Public</h3><p>VisualAcademy public pages, projects and course links.</p><a href="/Services">Services →</a></article>
    <article><span class="az-feature-icon">⌘</span><h3>Docs</h3><p>DocFX builds public Markdown. Protected Markdown is served through MVC after authorization.</p><a href="/Articles">Articles →</a></article>
    <article><span class="az-feature-icon">▦</span><h3>Dashboard</h3><p>Blazor 실전 예제와 업무 관리 메뉴를 Azunt 스타일 사이드바에서 탐색하세요.</p><a href="/dashboard">Dashboard →</a></article>
    <article><span class="az-feature-icon">◉</span><h3>Account</h3><p>ASP.NET Core Identity 기반 로그인, 회원가입, 계정 설정 화면을 이용하세요.</p><a href="/Identity/Account/Login">Sign in →</a></article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="az-developer-band">
 <div class="az-shell-width az-developer-grid">
  <div><span class="az-eyebrow az-light">VisualAcademy</span><h2>Learning meets working software.</h2><p>Razor Pages, ASP.NET Core MVC, Blazor Server와 Identity가 함께 동작하는 실전 프로젝트입니다.</p><a class="az-button az-button-primary" href="/dashboard">Explore dashboard</a></div>
  <pre><code>visualacademy/
├─ Public pages      Razor Pages + MVC
├─ dashboard/        Blazor Server
├─ Articles/         Board
├─ StandardReports/  Reports
└─ Identity/         Authentication</code></pre>
 </div>
</section>
